      "content": "Read API for scientific-service providers (suppliers) on the Science Exchange R&D marketplace. Exposes a provider's RFQs, quotes, services, facilities, line items, ratings, tags, users and related resources. Derived from the first-party se_providers_api_client Ruby wrapper (github.com/scienceexchange/se_providers_api_client); authoritative reference at https://demo.scienceexchange.com/api-docs/providers.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Science Exchange Engineering\n Email: devs@scienceexchange.com",
